new here at 11 o'clock two men save a  life at a local soccer game what started  as a normal day in march took a turn for  one woman who had a heart attack  watching her granddaughters play now  luckily though law enforcement officers  were there to step in and today they  were honored for their efforts sasha  loftus joining us tonight with the  details denise and brian these two men  were at the right place at exactly the  right time today as they reunited with  the woman they saved she said she will  never forget the second chance they've  given her  i didn't believe it  what started as a normal day at her  granddaughter's spring soccer game  suddenly turned terrifying for gene  dahlberg when my son turned around and  screamed help gene had a heart attack  and wasn't breathing that's when these  two jumped into action i hear screaming  i turned back and i see gene slumped  over in the chair metro police officer  brandon alvarado who was coaching the  game and his brother-in-law nevada state  trooper charles abernathy tapped into  their training we laid her down  started chest compressions with the help  of an icu nurse who was also in the  right place at the right time they were  able to keep gene alive and get her to  the hospital receiving the red cross  life saving award and three months later  she was here  to see abernathy and alvarado each  receive a red cross life-saving award  now as she moves forward  jean says she will never forget what  these two men gave her there's no words  to explain how grateful i am and they  know their decision to step in made all  the difference in the world there's just  a happiness that kind of overwhelms you  when you you see that you did something  to help somebody else have more days on  this earth  jean says because these chest  compressions were done so quickly she  didn't lose much oxygen to her brain and  has really recovered well and these  officers they encourage everyone to get  cpr  certified which is possible to help save  a life in this similar situation you  know we've talked about this before  we've gone through the certification but  it's been so many years you wonder if  you remember in an incident like that  yeah i think you have to redo it every  couple years they have a lot of classes  in las vegas and people want to check  them out we have them on our website  yeah i did one as well years ago and i  don't think i'd remember it you need the  refresher course a couple hours yeah  exactly saturday afternoon knock it out  for sure thanks
 

